# This crate is consumed as a path dependency by host apps that build in
# a container (passed to it as a named build context), so
# the directory is a build context even though nothing here builds an
# image of its own. Without this file every such build uploads `target/`
# to the daemon — half a gigabyte that no image layer wants.

# Build output.
target/
**/target/

# Secrets and local databases. A SQLite file copied into an image is a
# stale-state bug and a data leak at once.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
var/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal

# Nothing a dependent crate compiles reads these.
.git/
.github/
docs/
e2e/
**/node_modules/
.playwright-mcp/
*.log

# Editor / OS noise.
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
